WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.550
It was the day of the royal race.

2
00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:20.572
All the carriages were ready at the starting line.

3
00:00:20.573 --> 00:00:23.613
One carriage was made of feathers.

4
00:00:23.614 --> 00:00:25.406
It was very light.

5
00:00:25.407 --> 00:00:28.649
It floated above the ground.

6
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:31.965
Another carriage was pulled by unicorns.

7
00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:35.424
The unicorns looked very fast.

8
00:00:35.425 --> 00:00:39.491
Walter stood near a carriage that sparkled with magic.

9
00:00:39.492 --> 00:00:43.689
It was pulled by seven white swans.

10
00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:46.239
Tom gulped.

11
00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:49.746
"What if my king doesn't win?" he said.

12
00:00:49.747 --> 00:00:52.823
"I will go to the Grim Dungeon.

13
00:00:52.824 --> 00:00:56.214
Walter will laugh and laugh."

14
00:00:56.215 --> 00:00:59.936
"You have a good heart," said Cat.

15
00:00:59.937 --> 00:01:03.748
"Everything will work out fine. You'll see."

16
00:01:03.749 --> 00:01:07.774
Walter looked at the wings on the king’s carriage.

17
00:01:07.775 --> 00:01:10.494
"Ha-ha!" he said.

18
00:01:10.495 --> 00:01:12.924
"Your spell won't work, Tom.

19
00:01:12.925 --> 00:01:15.933
Your king will lose for sure."

20
00:01:15.934 --> 00:01:19.110
Walter's swans hissed at Tom.

21
00:01:19.111 --> 00:01:22.580
When they saw Cat, they flapped their wings.

22
00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:25.282
They tried to chase her.

23
00:01:25.283 --> 00:01:28.583
Cat hid in Tom's pocket.

24
00:01:28.584 --> 00:01:31.684
"Those swans are mean!" Tom said.

25
00:01:31.685 --> 00:01:45.280
"Just like Walter!"

26
00:01:45.281 --> 00:01:53.838
Finally the kings climbed onto their carriages.

27
00:01:53.839 --> 00:01:59.002
The wizards got on too.

28
00:01:59.003 --> 00:02:01.724
Cat jumped out of Tom's pocket.

29
00:02:01.725 --> 00:02:13.453
"Good luck. I'll wait at the finish line to see who wins!"

30
00:02:13.454 --> 00:02:22.083
A trumpet blared.

31
00:02:22.084 --> 00:02:32.572
And the royal race began!

